From 2a5460cafe7de465690a763288e59bcce5b0b59a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:05:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(update-pause): only a turn without its own marker is
 carried; a retried own pause is not

Review 5886751258 (PR #1888): the hook judged carried from marker.reason, so a turn retrying its own
pause after a failed job stop (write-ahead mark already core_update_pause) was stamped carried_turn_paused
and its continuation named a notification turn that never ran. The caller now passes carried=not
st.marker_key; the marker reason only decides whether the pause is counted again.
---
